# Aquila Change: heretic side path, Ether of the Newborn

knowledge-path-side-s6-ether-name = Ether of the Newborn
knowledge-path-side-s6-ether-desc =
    The newborn knew neither pain nor name. I will drink what is left of his first breath.

    Allows you to transmute a glass shard and a pool of vomit into Ether of the Newborn.
    The ether fully heals you, removes all subdermal implants and puts you to sleep for a minute.

